<title>JAPAN: Iwaki -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Iwaki -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 30.19		vs	   28.67</p>
<p> Operating	  141    million	  vs	   41    million</p>
<p> Current	    206    million	  vs	  217    million</p>
<p> Net		  110    million	  vs	  100    million</p>
<p> EPS		    4.54 yen	  vs	    4.14 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.75 yen	  vs	    2.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Iwaki &amp; Co Ltd is a leading wholesaler of pharmaceutical materials and products.</p>
